# Agent worktrees, rehearsal artefacts and scratch reference material. `.claude`
# alone is ~950 MB of full checkouts an isolated agent run left behind, and
# `COPY . .` was shipping all of it into the build context on every image build.
# `.gitignore` has said so about `.claude/worktrees/` for a while; this file
# never got the matching entry.
